Yes, this is one of those discrepancies for which, at run-time, if it is sum(x[n1:n2]) where n1 and n2 are run-time values, it would be a bit tricky to trap cases where uncompiled (pure R) execution is different due to n2 < n1.  Maybe we should support decreasing indices in compilation.  I'm forgetting why we didn't.  Possibly out of caution.  Possibly because decreasing indices are not supported in models (although that is quite a different context).

